      "details": "\r\n<p>Both the Notitia Dignitatum and the Ravenna Cosmography preserve the form \"<a title=\"Magnis\" class=\"internal-link\" href=\"magnis\">Magnis</a>\", which many scholars regard as a locative form of \"Magna\".&nbsp;Rivet and Smith in \"Place Names-of Roman Britain\" (1979) has a detailed description of the presumed morphology of the British (or possibly Latin) forms.</p>\r\n",
